@startuml
skinparam BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam titleFontSize 20
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #455A64
skinparam stateBorderColor #455A64
top to bottom direction
title Trash, restore and permanent deletion

state "History" as HISTORY #E3F2FD
state "Trash\nStill encrypted" as TRASH #FFF3E0
state "Removed from\nthe current vault" as REMOVED #FFEBEE

[*] --> HISTORY
HISTORY -right-> TRASH : Trash
TRASH -left-> HISTORY : Restore
HISTORY --> REMOVED : Confirm\nDelete permanently
TRASH -right-> REMOVED : Confirm\nDelete permanently

note top of TRASH #E1F5FE
  Names and sensitivity survive restore.
  Retention limits can also expire entries.
end note
note bottom of HISTORY
  Manual Trash or permanent deletion clears
  the clipboard only if its text still matches.
end note
note bottom of REMOVED #FFEBEE
  Only after a successful snapshot save.
  Failed saves keep the previous history.
  Other copies and backups may remain.
end note

